alchemy_requestPaymasterTokenQuote.description:
Returns an estimated conversion rate to sponsor with an ERC-20 token.
Args:
- {token, entryPoint, ...}
Returns: {minConversionRate, token, expiry}

alchemy_getAssetTransfers.description:
Fetches historical transfers matching the filter.
Args:
- filter: {fromBlock?, toBlock?, fromAddress?, toAddress?, contractAddresses?, category?, maxCount?, pageKey?, withMetadata?}
Returns: {transfers: [...], pageKey?}

alchemy_getAssetTransfersV2.description:
V2 variant for asset transfers (single block or filters).
Args: filter object (see docs).
Returns: {transfers: [...], pageKey?}

alchemy_getTransactionReceipts.description:
Gets all transaction receipts for a block.
Args:
- {blockNumber}|{blockHash}
Returns: {receipts: TransactionReceipt[]}
